<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Granite started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Granite started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said on Thursday it started coverage of Granite Broadcasting with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Tim Wallace said in a research note the second half of the year should produce accelerating cash flow growth.</p>
<p>-- But Wallace said leverage and trading liquidity could constrain upside in the stock.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1/4 to 10-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
